<title>USA: Bismarck SD 25, Ark. won by First Commercial.</title>
<headline>Bismarck SD 25, Ark. won by First Commercial.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Commercial Trust Co. said it won $1.290 million of Bismarck School District No. 25, Ark., refunding and construction bonds, Series B, with a net interest cost of 5.2044 percent.</p>
